{"key": "[\"On the ridge at Sikri lives the Sufi Shaikh Salim Chishti, who foretold the birth of Akbar's son. Here, in 1571, Akbar builds a city. In its hall of worship he sits with Sunni and Shia scholars, Brahmins, Jains and Jesuits. In 1585 he leaves for the frontier, and the court never settles here again.\", \"sarvam:varun_en_suspense@en-IN\", \"+6%\", \"+0Hz\", {}, \"fx5\"]", "mp3": "/Users/saidevdhal/Desktop/Codes/indianepics/public/audio/en/fatehpur-sikri.mp3", "duration": 21.806167, "words": [{"t": 0.0, "d": 0.3964757636363636, "w": "On"}, {"t": 0.3964757636363636, "d": 0.3964757636363636, "w": "the"}, {"t": 0.7929515272727272, "d": 0.3964757636363636, "w": "ridge"}, {"t": 1.1894272909090908, "d": 0.3964757636363636, "w": "at"}, {"t": 1.5859030545454544, "d": 0.3964757636363636, "w": "Sikri"}, {"t": 1.982378818181818, "d": 0.3964757636363636, "w": "lives"}, {"t": 2.3788545818181817, "d": 0.3964757636363636, "w": "the"}, {"t": 2.7753303454545453, "d": 0.3964757636363636, "w": "Sufi"}, {"t": 3.171806109090909, "d": 0.3964757636363636, "w": "Shaikh"}, {"t": 3.5682818727272725, "d": 0.3964757636363636, "w": "Salim"}, {"t": 3.964757636363636, "d": 0.3964757636363636, "w": "Chishti,"}, {"t": 4.3612334, "d": 0.3964757636363636, "w": "who"}, {"t": 4.757709163636363, "d": 0.3964757636363636, "w": "foretold"}, {"t": 5.154184927272727, "d": 0.3964757636363636, "w": "the"}, {"t": 5.5506606909090905, "d": 0.3964757636363636, "w": "birth"}, {"t": 5.947136454545454, "d": 0.3964757636363636, "w": "of"}, {"t": 6.343612218181818, "d": 0.3964757636363636, "w": "Akbar's"}, {"t": 6.740087981818181, "d": 0.3964757636363636, "w": "son."}, {"t": 7.136563745454545, "d": 0.3964757636363636, "w": "Here,"}, {"t": 7.533039509090909, "d": 0.3964757636363636, "w": "in"}, {"t": 7.929515272727272, "d": 0.3964757636363636, "w": "1571,"}, {"t": 8.325991036363636, "d": 0.3964757636363636, "w": "Akbar"}, {"t": 8.7224668, "d": 0.3964757636363636, "w": "builds"}, {"t": 9.118942563636363, "d": 0.